; Form 2's out-of-range index is a reported runtime domain failure: one
; diagnostic, no `:index 2` entry, and the three neighbours unaffected.
; The path is empty because the eval pass anchors at the form's head span
; — the arguments type-check; it is the computed index that is out of
; range.
(diagnostics
  (diagnostic :code expr_type_mismatch :path []))
(values
  (value :index 0 :result 10)
  (value :index 1 :result 30)
  (value :index 3 :result 4)
  (value :index 4 :result 0))
